<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48539" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσπ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ὁ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span> (acc.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσπιδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					25.452
				</span></i>
			, dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				45.133
			</span></i>): (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσπέσιος</span>):—<i>filled with the words of
				God, inspired</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> in acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσπιν; ἀοιδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.385
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοιδή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.328
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.498
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				425
			</span></i> (lyr.); also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσπιν αὐδάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					244
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			generally, <i>wondrous, awful</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσπις ἄελλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ven.</u>
					208
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσπιδες: θυσίαι, θεοσέβειαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
